          "r16.p1",
          "r20.p1"
        ],
        "text": "The records describe persistent right knee pain and intermittent dizziness, along with a clinician-observed right ankle sprain and swelling. The patient also wondered whether headaches relate to screen use; no cause or diagnosis was established. A prior wrist fracture from 2015 was reported healed. Knee exercises were recommended twice daily if comfortable, with instructions to stop if pain worsens. Future glucose tolerance and repeat iron testing were recommended, and test-result review was planned for a next appointment. The records also include a two-week follow-up booking instruction and a plan to call the clinic if symptoms worsen."
      }
    ],
